        "text": "Page: Dragonfly (Ziggy Marley album). Sentence: The track \"Rainbow in the Sky\" features both Flea and John Frusciante of the Red Hot Chili Peppers, while \"Melancholy Mood\" features only Flea.\nPage: Flea (musician). Sentence: Michael Peter Balzary (born 16 October 1962), better known by his stage name Flea, is an Australian-American musician and actor best known as bassist and founding member of the rock band Red Hot Chili Peppers.\nPage: Love Is My Religion. Sentence: Love Is My Religion is Ziggy Marley's second solo album, the first being \"Dragonfly\", after the 2000 end of Ziggy Marley & The Melody Makers.",
